{
  "about": [
    "What each wheel offers for a selection of files, in petal order. The Mac app, the shared core of the Windows and",
    "Linux apps, and the Android app each keep their own catalog; their tests all read this one file, so a choice",
    "added to or dropped from one of them shows up here.",
    "",
    "An entry is a choice's id, or an object when the choice is not for every platform:",
    "  only      the platforms that have it (mac, windows, linux)",
    "  not       the platforms that lack it",
    "  optional  true when it depends on what is installed (Pages, Keynote, PowerPoint, LibreOffice), so a test",
    "            accepts it present or absent",
    "A test makes empty files with these names in a scratch folder; a name ending in / is a folder.",
    "Every selection gets the same Actions wheel, listed once."
  ],
  "actions": [
    { "id": "action.airdrop", "only": ["mac"] },
    { "id": "action.share", "not": ["mac"] },
    "action.float",
    "action.copy",
    "action.move",
    "action.paths",
    "action.terminal"
  ],
